1. Definitions

"Software" means the Hitori VPN desktop client, including its source code and
documentation, in each version released by hitoricloud.

"Authorized Infrastructure" means servers and systems operated by
hitoricloud or by partners holding a written agreement with
hitoricloud that permits such operation ("Partners").

"Competing Use" means making the Software, or any work based on it,
available to anyone other than yourself by running it on
infrastructure that is not Authorized Infrastructure, or offering
the Software's functionality, or substantially similar functionality
derived from it, as a product or service to others.

"Change Date" means the tenth (10th) anniversary of the date on
which hitoricloud first made a given version of the Software
available.

"Future License" means the Apache License, Version 2.0.

